 "card": {
  "source_citation": "Sepia portrait supplied by the project owner, Kevin Haas, on 12 November 2026 as the likeness to use for Sarah Grey in the 1904 scene (\"Use these as the models for William and Sarah Grey ... since we do not have photos of them you can use these likenesses\"). Sitter, maker and date not recorded.",
  "source_url": "https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago-evidence/blob/4c262dd37f52a0e783cd17fd23ecba849a49e5e9/evidence/grey-likenesses-2026-11-12/pa1904_grey_mrs_w_l/owner_sarah_grey_likeness.png",
