  "marks": 450,
  "portrait": "humans/web/portraits/pa1904_grey_mrs_w_l_portrait.jpg",
  "model": "humans/web/portraits/pa1904_grey_mrs_w_l_model.jpg",
  "stand_in": "No photograph of Sarah Grey is known. This is a stand-in the project's owner chose as her likeness: a sepia portrait of a woman in a dark day dress with a lace collar and a cameo brooch, her hair drawn up to a knot on the crown. Its sitter is not recorded. Her face, hair and dress are the model's guide; it is not Sarah Grey."
 }
